message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."

title: "HBA-CM2: Offline Ocean Heat-Budget Analysis for ACCESS-CM2"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Sullivan"
    given-names: "Arnold"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5712-6195"

version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-23

repository-code: "https://github.com/arnoldsu/hba_170926_cm2"

keywords:
  - ocean heat budget
  - heat-budget analysis
  - ACCESS-CM2
  - ENSO
  - ocean advection
  - surface heat flux
  - upper ocean
  - climate model
  - offline diagnostics

abstract: >-
  HBA-CM2 provides an offline upper-ocean heat-budget analysis workflow
  using archived ACCESS-CM2 ocean and surface-flux fields. The workflow
  diagnoses upper-ocean temperature tendency and contributions from zonal,
  meridional, and vertical ocean advection and surface heat flux, with
  applications to ENSO and equatorial Pacific temperature variability.

